{"seq":1,"slug":"kubernetes-admission","title":"Kubernetes 准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/kubernetes-admission","wordCount":1406,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"kubernetes-准入控制\">Kubernetes 准入控制</h1><p>Kubernetes 准入控制是策略即代码应用最广泛的场景。通过在 API Server 的请求处理链路中插入策略检查点，可以在资源被持久化到 etcd 之前拦截不合规的配置变更。本章深入讲解 Kubernetes 准入控制的工作机制，以及两大主流方案 OPA Gatekeeper 和 Kyverno 的对比与实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"准入控制工作机制\">准入控制工作机制</h2><p>Kubernetes API Server 在处理每个请求时，会依次经过认证、授权和准入控制三个阶段。准入控制是最后一道防线，也是唯一可以修改或拒绝请求的环节。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as 客户端&#10;    participant API as API Server&#10;    participant Auth as 认证&#10;    participant AuthZ as 授权&#10;    participant MW as Mutating&lt;br/&gt;准入控制器&#10;    participant VW as Validating&lt;br/&gt;准入控制器&#10;    participant ET as etcd&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;API: kubectl apply -f pod.yaml&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;Auth: 验证身份&#10;    Auth--&gt;&gt;API: 认证通过&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;AuthZ: 检查 RBAC 权限&#10;    AuthZ--&gt;&gt;API: 授权通过&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;MW: Mutating 准入审查&#10;    MW--&gt;&gt;API: 返回修改后的对象(JSON Patch)&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;VW: Validating 准入审查&#10;    VW--&gt;&gt;API: allow / deny&#10;    alt allow&#10;        API-&gt;&gt;ET: 持久化资源&#10;        API--&gt;&gt;Client: 201 Created&#10;    else deny&#10;        API--&gt;&gt;Client: 403 Forbidden + 原因&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as 客户端\n    participant API as API Server\n    participant Auth as 认证\n    participant AuthZ as 授权\n    participant MW as Mutating&lt;br/&gt;准入控制器\n    participant VW as Validating&lt;br/&gt;准入控制器\n    participant ET as etcd\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;API: kubectl apply -f pod.yaml\n    API-&gt;&gt;Auth: 验证身份\n    Auth--&gt;&gt;API: 认证通过\n    API-&gt;&gt;AuthZ: 检查 RBAC 权限\n    AuthZ--&gt;&gt;API: 授权通过\n    API-&gt;&gt;MW: Mutating 准入审查\n    MW--&gt;&gt;API: 返回修改后的对象(JSON Patch)\n    API-&gt;&gt;VW: Validating 准入审查\n    VW--&gt;&gt;API: allow / deny\n    alt allow\n        API-&gt;&gt;ET: 持久化资源\n        API--&gt;&gt;Client: 201 Created\n    else deny\n        API--&gt;&gt;Client: 403 Forbidden + 原因\n    end</pre><p>准入控制的两个阶段各有分工：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>可否修改对象</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mutating</td>\n<td>修改请求中的对象</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>注入 sidecar、设置默认值、添加标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Validating</td>\n<td>验证对象是否合规</td>\n<td>不可以</td>\n<td>安全检查、资源限制验证、合规审计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键区别：</strong> Mutating 准入控制器在 Validating 之前执行。这意味着 Validating 控制器看到的是经过所有 Mutating 控制器修改后的最终对象。如果一个 Mutating 控制器注入了一个容器，Validating 控制器会基于包含该容器的完整对象进行验证。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"opa-gatekeeper\">OPA Gatekeeper</h2><p>OPA Gatekeeper 是基于 OPA 的 Kubernetes 准入控制方案，通过 CRD（Custom Resource Definition）提供声明式的策略管理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构组件\">架构组件</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Gatekeeper 组件&#10;        CT[ConstraintTemplate&lt;br/&gt;约束模板]&#10;        CON[Constraint&lt;br/&gt;约束实例]&#10;        AUD[Audit Controller&lt;br/&gt;审计控制器]&#10;        WEB[Admission Webhook&lt;br/&gt;准入 Webhook]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 用户交互&#10;        KUB[kubectl apply] --&gt; CT&#10;        KUB --&gt; CON&#10;    end&#10;    API[K8s API Server] --&gt; |准入请求| WEB&#10;    WEB --&gt; |Rego 评估| OPA[OPA 引擎]&#10;    CT --&gt; |编译 Rego| OPA&#10;    CON --&gt; |参数化| OPA&#10;    AUD --&gt; |定期扫描| RES[集群资源]&#10;    AUD --&gt; |生成违规| VI[violations 状态]\">graph TD\n    subgraph Gatekeeper 组件\n        CT[ConstraintTemplate&lt;br/&gt;约束模板]\n        CON[Constraint&lt;br/&gt;约束实例]\n        AUD[Audit Controller&lt;br/&gt;审计控制器]\n        WEB[Admission Webhook&lt;br/&gt;准入 Webhook]\n    end\n    subgraph 用户交互\n        KUB[kubectl apply] --&gt; CT\n        KUB --&gt; CON\n    end\n    API[K8s API Server] --&gt; |准入请求| WEB\n    WEB --&gt; |Rego 评估| OPA[OPA 引擎]\n    CT --&gt; |编译 Rego| OPA\n    CON --&gt; |参数化| OPA\n    AUD --&gt; |定期扫描| RES[集群资源]\n    AUD --&gt; |生成违规| VI[violations 状态]</pre><p>Gatekeeper 的核心概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ConstraintTemplate</td>\n<td>定义策略逻辑（Rego）和参数 schema</td>\n<td>函数定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Constraint</td>\n<td>实例化模板，指定匹配范围和参数</td>\n<td>函数调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Audit</td>\n<td>后台定期扫描已有资源，检查合规性</td>\n<td>持续合规检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sync</td>\n<td>将集群资源同步到 OPA 供策略引用</td>\n<td>数据上下文</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"constrainttemplate-示例\">ConstraintTemplate 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: templates.gatekeeper.sh/v1&#10;kind: ConstraintTemplate&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: k8srequireresourcelimits&#10;spec:&#10;  crd:&#10;    spec:&#10;      names:&#10;        kind: K8sRequireResourceLimits&#10;      validation:&#10;        openAPIV3Schema:&#10;          type: object&#10;          properties:&#10;            exemptImages:&#10;              type: array&#10;              items:&#10;                type: string&#10;  targets:&#10;    - target: admission.k8s.gatekeeper.sh&#10;      rego: |&#10;        package k8srequireresourcelimits&#10;&#10;        violation[{&quot;msg&quot;: msg}] {&#10;          container := input.review.object.spec.containers[_]&#10;          not container.resources.limits.memory&#10;          not is_exempt(container.image)&#10;          msg := sprintf(&quot;容器 %v 未设置内存限制&quot;, [container.name])&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        is_exempt(image) {&#10;          exempt := input.parameters.exemptImages[_]&#10;          startswith(image, exempt)&#10;        }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">templates.gatekeeper.sh/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ConstraintTemplate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">k8srequireresourcelimits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  crd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      names</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">K8sRequireResourceLimits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      validation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        openAPIV3Schema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          properties</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            exemptImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">array</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              items</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  targets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">admission.k8s.gatekeeper.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      rego</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        package k8srequireresourcelimits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        violation[{\"msg\": msg}] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          container := input.review.object.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          not container.resources.limits.memory</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          not is_exempt(container.image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          msg := sprintf(\"容器 %v 未设置内存限制\", [container.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        is_exempt(image) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          exempt := input.parameters.exemptImages[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          startswith(image, exempt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"constraint-示例\">Constraint 示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: constraints.gatekeeper.sh/v1beta1&#10;kind: K8sRequireResourceLimits&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: require-memory-limits&#10;spec:&#10;  match:&#10;    kinds:&#10;      - apiGroups: [&#39;&#39;]&#10;        kinds: [&#39;Pod&#39;]&#10;    namespaces:&#10;      - &#39;production&#39;&#10;  parameters:&#10;    exemptImages:&#10;      - &#39;registry.example.com/infra/&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">constraints.gatekeeper.sh/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">K8sRequireResourceLimits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">require-memory-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiGroups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        kinds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Pod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespaces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'production'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  parameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    exemptImages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'registry.example.com/infra/'</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kyverno\">Kyverno</h2><p>Kyverno 是一个 Kubernetes 原生的策略引擎，专为 Kubernetes 设计，使用 YAML 而非专用语言定义策略。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略类型\">策略类型</h3><p>Kyverno 支持四种策略类型，覆盖准入控制的全部需求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Kyverno 策略类型&#10;        V[Validate&lt;br/&gt;验证策略]&#10;        M[Mutate&lt;br/&gt;变更策略]&#10;        G[Generate&lt;br/&gt;生成策略]&#10;        C[Cleanup&lt;br/&gt;清理策略]&#10;    end&#10;    V --&gt; |检查合规| R1[allow/deny]&#10;    M --&gt; |修改对象| R2[注入默认值]&#10;    G --&gt; |创建关联资源| R3[自动创建 NetworkPolicy]&#10;    C --&gt; |清理过期资源| R4[删除过期的 Pod]\">graph TD\n    subgraph Kyverno 策略类型\n        V[Validate&lt;br/&gt;验证策略]\n        M[Mutate&lt;br/&gt;变更策略]\n        G[Generate&lt;br/&gt;生成策略]\n        C[Cleanup&lt;br/&gt;清理策略]\n    end\n    V --&gt; |检查合规| R1[allow/deny]\n    M --&gt; |修改对象| R2[注入默认值]\n    G --&gt; |创建关联资源| R3[自动创建 NetworkPolicy]\n    C --&gt; |清理过期资源| R4[删除过期的 Pod]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略类型</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>示例场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Validate</td>\n<td>验证资源是否符合规则</td>\n<td>禁止 latest 标签、要求资源限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutate</td>\n<td>修改或添加资源字段</td>\n<td>注入 sidecar、添加默认标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Generate</td>\n<td>自动创建关联资源</td>\n<td>创建 Namespace 时自动生成 ResourceQuota</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleanup</td>\n<td>清理过期或孤儿资源</td>\n<td>删除超过 30 天的 Completed Pod</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"validate-策略示例\">Validate 策略示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: kyverno.io/v1&#10;kind: ClusterPolicy&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: require-resource-limits&#10;spec:&#10;  validationFailureAction: Enforce&#10;  background: true&#10;  rules:&#10;    - name: check-memory-limits&#10;      match:&#10;        any:&#10;          - resources:&#10;              kinds:&#10;                - Pod&#10;              namespaces:&#10;                - production&#10;      validate:&#10;        message: &#39;容器必须设置内存限制&#39;&#10;        pattern:&#10;          spec:&#10;            containers:&#10;              - (name): &#39;*&#39;&#10;                resources:&#10;                  limits:&#10;                    memory: &#39;?*&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kyverno.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ClusterPolicy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">require-resource-limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color: